I'd guess neither wanting nor peace is the "real core" they're just two different framings.

@BellaRudd1 No need to be jealous, dear Bella;
Just join right in - that'd be stellar!
If you're up for buying
Social-norm defying,
Come bay-side, and I'll be the seller!

